=== 25: Test type reports a non-executable file found in PATH
status: 0
bash-n: 0
--- stdout
|[an executable later in PATH beats a non-executable earlier]
|nx is d2/nx
|rc=0
|nx is d2/nx
|rc=0
|D2
|run rc=0
|[only a non-executable exists]
|only is d1/only
|rc=0
|file
|rc=0
|d1/only
|rc=0
|d1/only
|rc=0
|type: only: not found
|rc=1
|run rc=126
|[the fallback keeps searching the rest of PATH]
|only2 is d2/only2
|rc=0
--- dir d1
--- file d1/nx
--- file d1/only
--- dir d2
--- file d2/nx
|#!/bin/sh
|echo D2
--- file d2/only2

